# Spark Platform (Flexmls) developer credentials.
# Get these from Settings -> My Developer Account at https://sparkplatform.com/developers
#
# Used by: the CLI example (npm run example) and the Vite dev-server proxy
# behind the browser examples (npm run example:web, see vite.config.ts).
# Spark's docs explicitly forbid sending this token to a browser and the API
# has no CORS support, so it is only ever read server-side — the browser
# examples never see it, they call a same-origin /api/listings route instead.
SPARK_ACCESS_TOKEN=
SPARK_USER_AGENT="YourBrokerage IDX/1.0"
